   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Indefinite article in the genitive",
     "texto": [
      "With «ein» in the genitive: **eines** (masculine and neuter) and **einer** (feminine): **statt eines Autos** (instead of a car), **einer Woche** (of a week). With **kein**: **keines**, **keiner**.",
      "Example: **Statt eines Autos nehme ich den Bus** (instead of a car, I take the bus)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "statt and eines Tages",
     "texto": [
      "**Statt** (instead of) also takes the genitive: **statt des Zuges** (instead of the train). Fixed expressions: **eines Tages** (one day, some day) and **eines Morgens** (one morning).",
      "Careful: **statt** is not related to «state»; it means \"instead of\"."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
